<title>GERMANY: MAN says group sales up 2 pct July to Nov.</title>
<headline>MAN says group sales up 2 pct July to Nov.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period from July to November 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,960   vs 6,800</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    9,100   up 6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German truck and machinery maker group is MAN AG.</p>
</text>
